Comment: 0,0:00:20.67,0:00:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Comment: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Idol activities!
Comment: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With a pop and a step, I've gotcha!
Comment: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{???}
Comment: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey everybody! Way to go!
Comment: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's Go!
Comment: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gracias! Or, as they say in English, "thank you"!
Comment: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get hyped to the max!
Comment: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax!
Comment: 0,0:00:33.43,0:00:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{takanaru watashi no mune no BPM???}
Comment: 0,0:00:36.02,0:00:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you how cute I am!
Comment: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Darkness! Be {I forget} mine demonic servants!
Comment: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining! May you receive Heaven's blessings!
Comment: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Howling! {something something something}-garu!
Comment: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{dunno}
Comment: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{i give up}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a great voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.73,0:01:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Oozora Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Manaka Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.74,0:01:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you too, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.78,0:05:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H9B1614&}Now wait a second-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now why the heck are two of you singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't this supposed to be a solo concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.25,0:05:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And who's that girl Laala's with-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Her singing and dancing was amazing!{She's an amazing singer and dancer!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't this supposed to be Akari's solo concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.97,0:05:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who that cutie pie next to her is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, now that I'm looking, \NI'm seeing a lot of faces I don't recognize...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not really sure how we ended up like this, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu! Ai-katsu! Ai-katsu! Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm Oozora Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm a third year at the idol middle school, \NStarlight Academy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.71,0:05:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today's our school event:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:05:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}a big idol get-together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the day of the Starlight Academy festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our friends, Kokone, Miyabi, and Niina\N are here to be our special guests!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's almost time to start the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up first, Akari. Put on a splendid show!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.27,0:06:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{And you bet} We'll be cheering for you from the audience!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.65,0:06:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm Manaka Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}6th year in primary school!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today's the "long time, no pri" \NParajuku Special Concert event!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tricolore's here as our special guests!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's almost concert time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're first up to pri today, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Being quick and decisive is key!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.61,0:06:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get the crowd fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please scan the necessary amount of PriTick—
Comment: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,え？
Comment: 0,0:08:14.35,0:08:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,ええ？
Comment: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,ー
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.31,0:08:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where the heck am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.11,0:08:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even seen this place before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you, by any chance, also an idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an idol, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to be doing a concert...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! So was I!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"Start Dash Sensation"...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey! That's the song I was supposed to sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.26,0:08:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a great song!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.53,0:09:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, would you like to sing it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a great voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Oozora Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Manaka Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you too, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It went something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We just kinda ended up singing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we just kinda ended up singing together!\NIs this just another day {in the life}for you-pri? {I feel like the line doesn't really match her expression. Need help rewording it so it matches. -C}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that certainly does sound like Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my God...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:09:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what in the world {\i1}is{\i0} this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Headmistress Orihime and Mr. Bepp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You lot certainly aren't Starlight Academy students.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.26,0:10:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm from Paprika Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"Paprika"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.39,0:10:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of any schools with that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is PriPara, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's "PriPara"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.56,0:10:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara is an idol theme park \Nwhere any girl can be an idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When we enter with our PriTickets,\Nwe all transform into an idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A place where any girl can be an idol!{and any non-binary if you're Shikyouin Hibiki}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.03,0:10:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol park called PriPara?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How fresh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess you guys can perform\N without going to PriPara, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Starlight Academy is dedicated to training idols,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,so we take lessons, go on the Starlight Stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and sometimes we get to do idol work outside school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are our idol activities, aka idol {\i1}katsudou!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We call them "aikatsu" for short!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"Idol {\i1}katsudou"?{\i0} "Aikatsu"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.73,0:11:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A school dedicated to idoling...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So you guys have a school that's\Njust about doing idol stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.78,0:11:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck, that sounds so fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have regular studies, of course.{We still have to keep up with our regular studies, too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara and Starlight Academy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Two places have become one...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe I can answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.29,0:11:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself. \NI'm PriPara's operator, Meganii.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Meganee, PriPara's other operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're from Starlight Academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,yet your stage changed upon going to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe this was due to some \Nsort of spatial transferrance by the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it the Aikatsu system?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran a scan of the area of this facility earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and a bug was detected in the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.69,0:11:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a glitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk with you two about these circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Both machines malfunctioning at once\N caused a rift in time and space.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result, two worlds that were never \Nsupposed to meet became one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And it would seem a special kind\N of place was created inside the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A rift containing two worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.13,0:12:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we trapped here-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, the gates to PriPara\N and Starlight Academy's worlds haven't disappeared. {this line is a bit too long. need help shortening it -C}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you can come and go quite freely. \NI believe this is an entirely new area altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A brand-new area!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of idols could gather here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like an idol paradise, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.99,0:12:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Headmistress, {he's literally saying "school mom" but that sounds stupid in English. Need ways to spice up the line. I'm trying to give Johnny a "hipster" vibe since that's what the JP is going for by using English.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,what should we do about the shows scheduled after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the question... \NEveryone was looking forward to those.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,May I offer my opinion on the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. We'll meet in the room over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.68,0:13:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, they'll be a while. \NFeel free to talk amongst yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.73,0:13:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna hear all about Starlight Academy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'd love to learn all about PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.61,0:13:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Shinjou Hinaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pop fit is absolutely killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.79,0:13:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,With a pop and a step, I've gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.17,0:13:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Mirei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bangs and hairclip are just adorbs-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.51,0:13:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.77,0:13:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Hikami Sumire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.77,0:13:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Dancing freely on stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:14:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The red rose of passion,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurebayashi Juri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.28,0:14:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Always in top form
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And prepared to strike first!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Toudou Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mucho gusto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Or, pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well met. Go-lad to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Are you two twins?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are absolutely lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.22,0:14:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys aren't half bad, yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.43,0:14:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've got nothin' on me and Reona. {"me and Reona", while not gramatically correct, sounds more like Dorothy to me. -C}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Dorothy! Don't be so rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.56,0:14:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl who dances like lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurosawa Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Amahane Madoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Super glad to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Guess they're not too shabby...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at all the girls here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've plenty of new demonic servants to be found{for the taking?}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so exciting-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So freakin' cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.10,0:15:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really great with goats! {Direct: good at milking}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my friend, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the cheerful idol,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Doujima Niina!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet y'all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet y'all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.75,0:15:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-They all look exactly alike...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange place...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.75,0:15:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the system!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.69,0:15:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara ding-dong...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We have an announcement regarding the status\N of the previously scheduled performances!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please gather around the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:16:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come to a decision regarding the planned shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.53,0:16:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Though we may have started \Nwith some unexpected issues,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,it's wonderful that Starlight Academy and PriPara,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,two different idol agencies,\Ncould meet here and form such meaningful connections with one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In celebration of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we've chosen to hold a joint performance extravaganza!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,An extravaganza?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.26,0:16:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Singing, dancing, and freedom, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring along whoever you want to sing with,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and get up on that stage and sing your hearts out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Additionally,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,we can directly transmit any song into your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,so no need to worry if you don't already know the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hop to it! The early bird gets the worm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna be the first to the stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the idol of all idols;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.03,0:16:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,in other words, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The center of the universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Kokoneー
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The most charming person in the world oughta go first, don'tcha think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.54,0:16:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.91,0:17:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyabi and I were going to go first!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I already called dibs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.96,0:17:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.10,0:17:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite enough, Kokone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being rather self-centered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.80,0:17:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I share her sentiment. You're out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Such grace and wisdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.81,0:17:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you perchance a martial artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.31,0:17:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wield a naginata. {it's like she "knows" the naginata, but "wield" makes more sense since it's a weapon. -c}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see such an extraordinary skill for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us do battle! Please, allow me to duel you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. I accept your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.99,0:17:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's take this elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Sion? What about the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyabi, what about singing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how about the two of us go-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lovely show.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You two totally killed it up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'd like to give performing a try, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it, girl! The stage is yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.05,0:19:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet everyone would love to hear\N your rendition of Tutu Ballerina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What kinda song is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a super ice cold but stylish song!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want icy cold, then look no further than Sophy-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.46,0:19:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:20:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She seemed pretty amicable to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.39,0:20:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.47,0:20:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Aroma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.71,0:20:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thou art demon kin through and through!{汝こそ悪魔の眷属}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldst thou join us in subjugating this realm?{我らと共に世界を征服しようではないか\N}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? A demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use hiding. Thy cards give thee away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thou art a vampire, predicting Armageddon\N with thy cursed cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the designers {\i1}are{\i0} a little demonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.42,0:20:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You do also enjoy fortune telling...{but did she predict Aromageddon, that's what I wanna know}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us and subjugate the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the offer, but I'd like to just perform...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She's out of control-pri...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.11,0:20:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say this calls for a Red Flash-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.31,0:20:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A pickled plum?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.75,0:20:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.19,0:20:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you prepared, my little cagebirds?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us make for the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:20:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.99,0:20:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.51,0:23:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.76,0:23:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh... Miyabi, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I was thinking we could sing together...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.83,0:23:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Those look like they're made out of super delicious candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.75,0:23:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so cute and yummy-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.34,0:23:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And, the lyrics are practically made out of sweets.{There's a whole lot of sweets-talk in the lyrics, too!}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.80,0:23:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The outfits and the song probably taste amazing-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.30,0:23:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna sing 'til our bellies are stuffed full!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about we sing together!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, then lemme sing with y'all!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.89,0:25:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How long're you gonna do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.85,0:25:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody keeps beating us to the punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.46,0:25:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Say,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.40,0:25:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to sing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.15,0:25:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nono!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.28,0:25:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Risa!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.99,0:25:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.73,0:27:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.23,0:27:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,for me
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.61,0:27:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to make my appearance!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.99,0:28:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gracias...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.41,0:28:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.75,0:28:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"thank you."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.20,0:28:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,De nada, señorita.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.35,0:28:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're most welcome, mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.65,0:28:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you rise with me to zeal's stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.67,0:28:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've the scent of a prodigy,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.63,0:28:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and even better,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.07,0:28:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't use those preposterous wordplays.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.09,0:28:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.28,0:28:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.08,0:28:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The blazing flame of revolution
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.66,0:28:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,ignited by Shikyouin Hibiki!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.34,0:30:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Juri, looked wonderful up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.05,0:30:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But what should we do...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.35,0:30:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vanilla Chili Pepper's song is meant for three people...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.67,0:30:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That footwork...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.81,0:31:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And her amazing swordsmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.95,0:31:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That was an excellent practice round{rehearsal}.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.74,0:31:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my sincerest gratitude. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.83,0:31:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.23,0:31:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look forward to facing off with you one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.59,0:31:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.00,0:31:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to join us for a show?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.55,0:31:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Opportunity only knocks once.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.87,0:31:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be glad to join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.58,0:31:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren'tcha forgetting someone over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.17,0:33:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.74,0:33:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and Reona are for sure going next,\N or you're gonna hear from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.16,0:33:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.64,0:33:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara ding-dong...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.34,0:33:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about 6 PM. The area will soon be closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.26,0:33:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.34,0:33:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We agreed to operate according \Nto the PriPara system's rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.30,0:33:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so no one is permitted to be here past 6 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.49,0:33:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We know everyone's excited, but this is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.58,0:34:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over already...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.54,0:34:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I really wanted to sing more...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.37,0:34:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But in on a lighter note, starting tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.22,0:34:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,whenever you visit this area,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.22,0:34:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,it may very well be possible to vist each other's worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.35,0:34:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This how we found each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.14,0:34:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so let's take the time to get to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.12,0:34:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.83,0:34:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.48,0:34:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can put on even more joint shows tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.96,0:34:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,See you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.21,0:34:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.34,0:34:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.03,0:34:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.67,0:34:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a good day-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.03,0:34:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You all too!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.58,0:34:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.01,0:34:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.93,0:34:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.53,0:34:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.79,0:34:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Right back at'cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.61,0:35:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.83,0:35:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My dorm...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.42,0:35:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,is usually here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.37,0:35:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.64,0:35:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.22,0:35:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumire, Hinaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.58,0:35:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.64,0:35:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen what they're saying online?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.21,0:35:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"The celebrity idol, Hoshimiya Ichigo has...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.40,0:35:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,changed her name to Hoshimiya Pineapple."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.52,0:35:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pineapple?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.40,0:35:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's cute, but...{It's not that it's not cute, but...}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.60,0:35:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It just feels wrong!{I just can't picture that!}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.30,0:35:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up in the news...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.91,0:35:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The idol group, Dancing Divas, \Nhave announced their sudden disbandment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.42,0:35:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They've said they plan to make their debut\N as a group of treasure hunters from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.28,0:35:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Impossible...
Comment: 0,0:35:52.05,0:35:53.96,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{Aikatsu Teacher script}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.32,0:35:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My part in Aikatsu Teacher{I'm not an actress in Aikatsu Teacher anymore?}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.05,0:35:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't a school teacher anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.37,0:36:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's "Stageplay Teacher"?!{I don't know about Juri's lines here. I'll have to re-look at the translation and do some asking because I think I'm missing Aikatsu-specific knowledge. -C}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.15,0:36:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.07,0:36:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This {\i1}is{\i0} my house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.69,0:36:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be an Italian restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.58,0:36:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Big Sis, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.20,0:36:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Non!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.92,0:36:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.30,0:36:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.70,0:36:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.97,0:36:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you called me "big sis"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.89,0:36:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so you must be my sister, Non, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.00,0:36:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.68,0:36:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really me. Your brother, Nonsuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.54,0:36:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nonsuke"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.73,0:36:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where did all these animals come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.18,0:36:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they're the mascots?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.61,0:36:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They look different.{Did something happen?}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.48,0:36:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Our monja sign changed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.07,0:37:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's it "Monja Ninja" instead of "Ninja Monja"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.81,0:37:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's not that different...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.50,0:37:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.38,0:37:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.27,0:37:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Something weird's going on with the real world!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.87,0:37:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? You guys had weird stuff happen, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.04,0:37:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.23,0:37:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like this fusion has had\Nan affect on the outside world, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.87,0:37:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all a bit uneasy about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.81,0:37:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We just wonder what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.33,0:37:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But, why man? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.55,0:37:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon doing some investigating, we uncovered a very significant fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.95,0:37:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Our two worlds connected,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.92,0:37:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and this fused space was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.29,0:37:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result, a fork in the space-time continuum appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.79,0:37:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A fork in the space-time continuum?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.75,0:37:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.73,0:37:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A fork in path of the flow of time was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.73,0:37:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've broken from the path in the flow of time you were supposed to follow,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.78,0:38:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and entered a different flow altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.01,0:38:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now new forks keep appearing,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.52,0:38:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and this space encounters new branches each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.57,0:38:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We've also discovered it's possible to jump to other parts of the path.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.76,0:38:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.08,0:38:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean we'll keep getting\Nsent to other messed-up worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.98,0:38:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.91,0:38:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll run into the next branch after three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.03,0:38:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've calculated the next one after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.95,0:38:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,will be 100 million years from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.62,0:38:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That long?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.33,0:38:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even begin to image what that'd be like-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.63,0:38:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So our original worlds will only continue to get farther away...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.95,0:38:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that means we'll never be able to go back to our \Noriginal worlds and see the people from them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.30,0:38:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Our friends and family aren't here...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.22,0:38:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fans who cheer us on...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.25,0:38:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, is there anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.86,0:38:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is merely conjecture,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.53,0:38:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we were somehow able to jump back to the first point of divergence
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.03,0:39:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it may be possible for us to return to the original timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.61,0:39:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.49,0:39:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That I cannot say for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.10,0:39:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the power which creates and sustains this space...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.63,0:39:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,is the radiance of idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.45,0:39:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If we were to be able to combine that radiance,\N we could bring about a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.05,0:39:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol's...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.28,0:39:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,radiance...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.64,0:39:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do we combine it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.82,0:39:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.74,0:39:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easy-peasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.14,0:39:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We just gotta put on a buncha shows!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.66,0:39:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ya think we'd shine really bright then?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.72,0:39:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.53,0:39:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.74,0:39:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to perform more anyways!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.90,0:39:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If we grab our friends and sing the songs we like,\Nthere's a lot we can sing-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.72,0:39:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be cheering you on!{Count me in?}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.32,0:39:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's only fair if Reona and I go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.59,0:39:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.39,0:39:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us sing with you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.52,0:39:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.87,0:39:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get hyped to the max!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.38,0:39:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.50,0:39:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultra maxxed!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.02,0:40:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.94,0:40:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get everything back to normal in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.59,0:41:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A small wormhole has appeared in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.44,0:41:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,10-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.75,0:41:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep up that momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.36,0:41:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Madoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.96,0:41:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.71,0:42:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a step forward and ring the bell of blessings
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.84,0:42:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and take a bite from this sweet, red apple
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.13,0:42:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,With just one bite,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.55,0:42:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you've already become our captive
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.89,0:42:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel there before me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.23,0:42:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My soul
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.56,0:42:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,twinges with unsatiable thirst
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.94,0:42:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We call out your name
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.74,0:42:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and invite you somewhere beyond fate
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.54,0:42:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,where darkness and light intermix
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.50,0:42:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Reversible Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.17,0:42:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A moebius strip wrapped around your finger
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.38,0:42:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The captivating demon and the smiling angel
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.09,0:42:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume change!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.60,0:43:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember we two maidens
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.23,0:43:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Reversible-Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.81,0:43:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A moebius strip wrapped around your finger
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.94,0:43:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear not
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.57,0:43:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and yield yourself to us
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.20,0:43:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Devil ＆ Angel;
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.62,0:43:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Worship we two maidens
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.83,0:43:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol's radiance;
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.89,0:43:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,for that, you need look no further than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.40,0:45:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time we go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.44,0:45:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up: the Kansai team!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.20,0:45:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give'em a good show!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.89,0:45:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt, I beseech of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.27,0:45:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The cauldron of hell hath been opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.91,0:46:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of the demons' night! {I dunno how to handle "demons' night"}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.24,0:46:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally our turn to sing and stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.84,0:46:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaarmageddon's show-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.20,0:46:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about all six of us sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.75,0:46:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Karmageddon{Sekimageddon}-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.86,0:48:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They've also produced radiance!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.95,0:48:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so close to a miracle-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.34,0:48:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The light faded...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.65,0:48:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The wormhole in the sky has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.23,0:48:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.88,0:48:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But why...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.39,0:48:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we'll need more power if we're going to move this space...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.15,0:48:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But can we even produce enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.26,0:48:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.58,0:48:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been performing day in and day out the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.32,0:48:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times is it gonna take before it's enough?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.82,0:48:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,After three days, it's gonna take 100 million years worth of power isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.65,0:48:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we even really bring about a miracle?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.68,0:48:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Will we ever be able to go back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.29,0:48:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.99,0:48:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can make a miracle happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.62,0:48:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we can! No matter how much work it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.54,0:48:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.59,0:49:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with Laala! We can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.84,0:49:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we almost did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.97,0:49:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.14,0:49:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We were all just strangers who'd never met until yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.51,0:49:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is how we met!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.06,0:49:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And we've been doing so many wonderful shows!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.44,0:49:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, when I first met you, I was really surprised!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.07,0:49:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And when we ended up performing \Ntogether, I had so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.65,0:49:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.01,0:49:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It really felt like the start of something new!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.19,0:49:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.72,0:49:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.95,0:49:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.75,0:49:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.33,0:49:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's sing together!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.92,0:49:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate amount\N of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.39,0:49:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.02,0:50:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The pink checks and layers are simply stunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.48,0:50:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the Starlight Academy Marching Coord
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.61,0:50:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink Parade Coord
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.16,0:50:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in another world, the feeling never changes!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.41,0:50:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The cute ribbons tie your memories together!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.62,0:50:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Twinkle Ribbon Cyalume Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.65,0:52:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala! Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.45,0:52:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.04,0:52:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about the show you just did really lifted our spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.87,0:52:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me believe we really can pull off a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.37,0:52:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed! You're laser focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.71,0:52:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to give gathering\N the idols's radiance another go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.03,0:52:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Laser focused?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.48,0:52:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I've been thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.49,0:53:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been doing all these thrown together performances, but what if instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.02,0:53:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,we prepared for one big, \Nbest of the best performance instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.37,0:53:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us together for the best performance ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.23,0:53:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying we should all work together for one big show-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.03,0:53:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds so fun-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.32,0:53:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have idols who perform on stage,\N and idols who support from the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.20,0:53:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be bringing all our radiance together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.01,0:53:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That certainly sounds like an idea worth trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.08,0:53:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll hold the show in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.96,0:53:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise that's our last chance\N for another 100 million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.63,0:53:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But who should we choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.76,0:53:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously it's—
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.63,0:53:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.03,0:53:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't Laala and Akari be good choices?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.39,0:53:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.39,0:53:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They were the first of us to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.16,0:53:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.69,0:53:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Akari and Miss Laala will be the \Ncenters in a brand new idol group!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.37,0:53:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's gotta be...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.96,0:53:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,the ones who had a smash hit concert! The super idols, Luminas!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.13,0:54:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix: SoLaMi Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.68,0:54:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we have our six members!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.35,0:54:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're SoLaMi Luminas!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.20,0:54:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.18,0:54:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch. Fine, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.67,0:54:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,, There's no sense in complaining. \NWe'll just have to play support.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.79,0:54:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are the supporters supposed to do-garu?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.45,0:54:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.60,0:54:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We could create a new ultimate special appeal...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.08,0:54:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we can create a new Making Drama!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.83,0:54:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we work on it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.25,0:54:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A Making Drama and Special Appeal put together...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.36,0:54:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I like the sound of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.65,0:54:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Special Making Drama Appeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.18,0:54:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha. That's a bit long.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.04,0:54:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How about Making Appeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.05,0:54:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I love that!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.72,0:54:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kiriya was here, she'd say "isn't this chill?"
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.18,0:54:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If Ms. Ajimi was here, she'd say "
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.35,0:54:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"That's such a splen-David idea-da Vinci!"
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.81,0:54:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've all agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.86,0:54:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The six members of SoLaMi Luminas\Nwill prepare to take the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.32,0:55:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else should put forth\Nmaximum effort to support them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.33,0:55:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.71,0:55:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of us will work on \Ncreating the best song for the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.08,0:55:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's get pumped up!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.80,0:55:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be doing everything we can to support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.84,0:55:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stylish!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.42,0:55:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.59,0:55:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Collaboration!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.48,0:55:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.39,0:55:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you forgetting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.09,0:55:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsubasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.27,0:55:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Cosmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.92,0:55:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The best performance deserves the best outfits, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.15,0:55:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got this cosmic covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.01,0:55:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala and her friends should be here any minute now!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.86,0:55:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to practicing with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.86,0:55:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Comment: 0,0:55:46.83,0:55:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.01,0:55:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.41,0:55:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.21,0:55:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.88,0:55:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.17,0:55:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going? Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.88,0:55:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's you, Laala?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.97,0:56:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So you really are a primary schooler...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.50,0:56:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.63,0:56:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Mirei?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.27,0:56:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really {\i1}that{\i0} shocking...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.54,0:56:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.39,0:56:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.25,0:56:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for having us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.41,0:56:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.34,0:56:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You good with doing our regular old training?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.25,0:56:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's totally okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.65,0:56:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu, ai-katsu, ai-katsu
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.41,0:56:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Their stamina is unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.67,0:56:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to have to put in \Novertime if we want to catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.06,0:56:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No way we're gonna let ourselves fall behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.91,0:56:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri! Para! Pri! Para!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.87,0:56:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.07,0:57:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.28,0:57:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.29,0:57:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock climbing...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.20,0:57:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Starlight Academy students\N are doing this every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.25,0:57:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,it's no wonder their idol abilities are on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.25,0:57:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more to go! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.83,0:57:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.59,0:57:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.01,0:57:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Sophy got blown away!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.96,0:57:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The center of the universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.84,0:57:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kokone!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.60,0:57:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think ya mean me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.73,0:57:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.27,0:57:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.86,0:57:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.94,0:57:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.10,0:57:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They just can't get their act together.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.77,0:57:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've made good progress nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.62,0:57:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! This is looking to be one awesome Making Appeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.29,0:58:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's chock full of idols' radiance!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.57,0:58:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we sure we can pull this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.86,0:58:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We only have one chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.28,0:58:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very true.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.53,0:58:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This has to be the best concert anyone's ever seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.12,0:58:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,otherwise it'll amount to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.37,0:58:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that gives me anxiety!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.37,0:58:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It still feels like something's missing...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.17,0:58:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I wonder what...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.76,0:58:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Top dawg, we have a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.90,0:58:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever is the matter, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.01,0:58:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When we were meeting about the\N new song, I heard from MegaBro — {MegaBro told me something while we were meeting about the new song}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.52,0:58:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"MegaBro"?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.10,0:58:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Meganii?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.16,0:58:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.23,0:58:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me the shocking truth!{I found out something totally crazy!}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.11,0:58:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.19,0:58:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The next performance will be the last one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.24,0:58:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.03,0:58:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Er, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.70,0:58:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of our idols will return things to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.35,0:58:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,meaning our two worlds will separate, \Nand we'll be cut off from each other forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.35,0:59:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So after that, we won't be able to meet up any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.25,0:59:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.42,0:59:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And if that wasn't bad enough, \Nwe'll lose our memory of all this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.09,0:59:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So we'll forget all about this wonderful meeting...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.01,0:59:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.14,0:59:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.52,0:59:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I should tell Oozora and the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.25,0:59:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope it doesn't make them hesitant to go on...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.40,0:59:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.98,0:59:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already told everyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.15,0:59:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.28,0:59:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I had the opportunity to gather everyone earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.95,0:59:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So how did they take the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.53,0:59:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So this will be our last performance...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.70,0:59:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And we won't be able to get together anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.58,0:59:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone was astonished at first, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.46,0:59:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But it didn't take long for them to perk back up and say,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.98,0:59:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who decided that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.48,0:59:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can make a miracle to turn our worlds back,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.40,0:59:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,we can make another miracle so we can meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.88,0:59:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made miracles before and we can do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.06,0:59:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,"We'll give it our everything."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.34,1:00:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to place our faith\N in our radiance and advance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.48,1:00:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.31,1:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we're idols!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.11,1:00:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We should place our hopes in them, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.24,1:00:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}know{\i0} those girls can bring about a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.01,1:00:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu! Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.26,1:00:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.96,1:00:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything here is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.87,1:00:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd totally come here every day!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.79,1:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at all those animals!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.00,1:00:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri-Para! Pri-Para!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.27,1:00:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Laala! You're as lively as ever!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.45,1:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about being an idol in PriPara\N makes me feel 100 times stronger!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.66,1:00:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your idol aura's increased 100 times over, too!{aura farming fr??????-C}{idk what to do with aura I'll fix it later probably}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.06,1:00:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of PriPara-pri!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.23,1:00:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're far too slow, my little cagebirds!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.77,1:00:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy moly!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.44,1:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the power of pickled plums-pri.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.92,1:00:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hologrammation!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.33,1:01:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We used the power of hologrammation to construct a 3000 meter rock wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.04,1:01:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.18,1:01:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.59,1:01:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.34,1:01:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first I've ever
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.17,1:01:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,climbed a rock wall this tall.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.80,1:01:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara is something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.14,1:01:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my winning idiot power!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.32,1:01:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,With the power of effort and calculations,\N we can't be beat!{We're unbeatable with the power of effort and calculations?}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.15,1:01:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.48,1:01:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri-Para!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.58,1:01:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.82,1:01:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.84,1:01:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I give up! I'm out of ideas!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.34,1:01:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then a change of pace is in order.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.08,1:01:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,At times like this, it's best to get up and get moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.35,1:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.21,1:01:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, how lovely!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.97,1:01:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,After that conversation, we all thought\N there must be some way we can pitch in!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.99,1:02:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We want the stage itself to be able to give off the brightest shine!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.93,1:02:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our aikatsu!{This really was our Aikatsu-PriPara movie.-C}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.23,1:02:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our way to say "we're all idols"!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.70,1:02:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like everyone's radiance
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.76,1:02:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,has come together!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.04,1:02:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,has come together!/united
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.67,1:02:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Excelente!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.63,1:02:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.71,1:02:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to pull ourselves together.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.05,1:02:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.06,1:02:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's climb together!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.68,1:02:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.69,1:02:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Each and every one of us shines in our own way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.27,1:02:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And when we bring all of our [word I used] together,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.32,1:02:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we'll put on the greatets show ever!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.53,1:02:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatcha guys lollygagging around for?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.87,1:02:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you all forgotten about the Making Appeal?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.29,1:02:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Has hell's banquet not started?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.91,1:02:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. Let's go wrap things up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.05,1:03:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.89,1:03:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally made it...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.60,1:03:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky looks stunning...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.77,1:03:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope everything works out tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.40,1:03:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't know until we try-pri.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.86,1:03:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do is give it our all.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.91,1:03:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.66,1:03:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have fun and go all out!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.67,1:03:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.09,1:03:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.18,1:03:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We call it the "Star Paradise Coord".
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.06,1:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking forward to working with you, partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.56,1:04:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out there and show us the greatest show ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.82,1:04:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll cosmically be cheering for you from the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.53,1:04:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.49,1:04:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up at the sky and smile
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.50,1:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones who twinkle and shine,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.74,1:05:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,we're SoLaMi Luminas!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.08,1:05:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.91,1:05:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A surprise-pri?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.21,1:05:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.25,1:05:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This rocks!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.30,1:05:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.97,1:06:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have the best time ever, so let's get hyped!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.15,1:06:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,When our two worlds met, I got to sing with you
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.37,1:06:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A miracle we found by chasing swinging notes
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.13,1:06:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Our final, destined stage
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.38,1:06:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The impossible is now possible, and we're so excited
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.14,1:06:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Altogether now! Let's take a dive into this play!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.10,1:06:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me feel even more of your Appeal
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.40,1:06:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we share the same motivation to do our best!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.03,1:06:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Passing through us, connecting us, I'm so glad we can shine like this
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.53,1:07:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we're idols! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.66,1:07:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Singing the melody that was made when we met
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.54,1:07:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll bring our voices together, uniting our glimmer as one
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.63,1:07:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear the sound of our racing hearts?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.68,1:07:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nature and happy tuning is what makes the sound of life
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.81,1:07:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it well -- this lyric starts it all
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.40,1:07:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're making miracles on this very stage
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.82,1:07:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Our voices reached them!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.82,1:07:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all friends, we're all idols!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.87,1:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make this miracle happen-pri!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.54,1:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Our feelings...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.08,1:07:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We should share those with them!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.75,1:07:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Our defiant, inspiring steps
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.83,1:07:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at everyone's cards!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.59,1:07:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We should all work together! Allow us to join!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.80,1:07:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One single step leads to infinite possibilities!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.34,1:07:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it your all and show how much you want it!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.22,1:07:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,These are PriTickets
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.85,1:08:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and Aikatsu cards!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.05,1:08:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it your all and show how much you want it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.81,1:08:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,For an idol, this is just the symbol of a new meeting
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.98,1:08:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Never lose your faith in everyone's courage
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.56,1:08:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been making miracles since the moment they met
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.14,1:08:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and now they'll be shining at the brightest they've ever been in this finale!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.32,1:08:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One day you'll find yourself casually humming this tune
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.90,1:08:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever forget the fun we had while we were together
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.82,1:08:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost time for the climax!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.21,1:08:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Get hyped to the max and go!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.63,1:08:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Singing the melody that was made when we met
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.92,1:08:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll bring our voices together, uniting our glimmer as one
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.06,1:08:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And the rhythm of our beating hearts comes together
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.10,1:08:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,With our smiles and happy tuning, let's create the best moment ever
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.69,1:08:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. These lyrics will last forver
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.57,1:09:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's sing this treasure
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.49,1:09:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, miracles are right within our grasp!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.79,1:09:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Making Appeal, switch on!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.50,1:09:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.66,1:09:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fans
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.75,1:09:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,coords
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.79,1:09:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.67,1:09:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,memories
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.67,1:09:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the future
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.72,1:09:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't be thankful enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.32,1:09:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The miraculous meeting!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.61,1:09:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol paradise for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.49,1:09:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.81,1:10:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the idols' radiance!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.56,1:10:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Success! Your chance is starting!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.90,1:10:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.70,1:10:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's snap!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.87,1:10:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.87,1:10:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,it's just goodbye until next time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.04,1:10:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's snap!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.72,1:10:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we'll meet again,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.55,1:10:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.84,1:10:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.55,1:10:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already evening?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.43,1:10:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wans't I supposed to perform today?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.23,1:10:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.94,1:10:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.19,1:10:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't remember a thing...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.07,1:11:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.90,1:11:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.03,1:11:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.57,1:11:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's supposed to be a special show...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.74,1:11:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about-pri?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.37,1:11:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The show's been over for a while...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.29,1:11:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.71,1:11:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.34,1:11:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.55,1:11:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,it's just goodbye until next time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.81,1:11:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we'll meet again,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.43,1:11:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.19,1:11:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,see you then!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.44,1:11:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again! It's a promise!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.75,1:11:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A message you'll remember even after 10,000 years;
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.75,1:12:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll share it with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.38,1:12:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My precious friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.18,1:12:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact we met means we were meant to be together
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.85,1:12:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can hear each other's songs
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.60,1:12:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,like we're singing in unison
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.15,1:12:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Place all of your goals into the cards and put your dreams into the ticket
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.70,1:12:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Carry friends
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.70,1:12:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again, but it feels like we won't have to wait
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.37,1:12:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When do you want to meet next?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.12,1:12:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have so much fun
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.79,1:12:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be together forever
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.13,1:12:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wonderful story -- let's start something new
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.68,1:12:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Pa-Pa-Ra Make it, Now!\NDu-Du-Wa DO IT, Now!!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.93,1:12:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Singing is how we understand each other!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.15,1:13:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Our show will never end
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.36,1:13:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Pretty Activites will continue forever
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.03,1:13:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even just one second
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.70,1:13:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet each other wearing the best coord sever
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.41,1:13:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to stop compliment each other
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.13,1:13:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gone back to our homes, but we can never talk enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.38,1:13:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether the present
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.14,1:13:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to see what's coming
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.93,1:13:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,in the future
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.64,1:13:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,(Our Dream Stage!)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.73,1:13:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the same generation, so let it resonate
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.23,1:13:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,(Our Dream Stage!)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.11,1:13:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a prism
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.32,1:13:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,shining is so many colors
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.76,1:14:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It might sometimes feel lonely
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.52,1:14:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but this promise is something we'll cherish
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.94,1:14:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So now when your heart beats
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.82,1:14:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,look forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.03,1:14:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.36,1:14:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll share our thanks with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.12,1:14:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,For all the time we've walked together side-by-side
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.71,1:14:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The amount of wonderful stories we have will continue growing
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.96,1:14:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Special Appeal! Making Drama!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.84,1:14:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep having miraculous meetings!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.89,1:14:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll shine forever
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.18,1:15:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,in our idol paradise
